"alacak yaratıcı, kendini geliştirmeye açık, değişen ve gelişen dünyaya ayak "
"uydurabilecek, ekip çalışmasına yatkın, çevreye duyarlı, sorumluluk sahibi, "
"girişimci ve bilgisiyle sektörde aranan kalifiye bireyler yetiştirmektir."
msgstr ""
"Taking into account the needs of the sector, our aim is to train qualified "
"individuals who will work in food and beverage businesses serving regional, "
"national and international areas, who are creative, open to self-"
"improvement, able to keep up with the changing and developing world, prone "
"to team work, environmentally sensitive, responsible, entrepreneurial and "
"sought after in the sector with their knowledge."

