"elemanları yetiştirme amacıyla kurulmuştur."
msgstr ""
"The Child Development Program, located within the Avrasya University "
"Vocational School of Health Services, was established with the aim of "
"training expert professionals who will handle the early development period "
"of the individual based on scientific foundations with a contemporary "
"education approach."

