"strong academic staff offered by our university, our students graduate as "
"individuals who are ready not only for today's but also the professional "
"dynamics of the future. We also offer a solid foundation to our students who"
" want to continue their academic careers by transferring to undergraduate "
"programs with vertical transfer opportunities."

