"olarak Diş Protez Teknolojisi bölümünde eğitimli akademik kadromuzla sizlere"
" en iyisini sunmak için elimizden geleni yapmaktayız."
msgstr ""
"With advancing technology, the field of dental prosthesis is constantly "
"changing and developing. As Avrasya University, we do our best to offer you "
"the best with our trained academic staff in the Department of Dental "
"Prosthesis Technology, in accordance with the developing technology."

