" tasarımı, animasyon gibi yaratıcı alanlarda üretim yapabilen ara teknik "
"elemanın yetişmesini sağlayarak, bu alanda duyulan istihdam açığını "
"gidermeyi hedeflemektedir."
msgstr ""
"The aim of our Graphic Design Associate Degree Program is to educate "
"individuals who are experts in communication design in all kinds of media, "
"from TV and other mass media to the Internet, and to eliminate the "
"employment gap in this field by training intermediate technical personnel "
"who can produce in creative fields such as photography, video, interactive "
"media design and animation."

