"Competence in informatics fields in addition to classical cartography fields"

#: .\harita_muhendisligi\templates\harita_muhendisligi\includes\harita_muhendisligi.html:302
#: .\harita_muhendisligi\templates\harita_muhendisligi\includes\harita_muhendisligi.html:469
msgid "Bilgi Teknolojileri"
msgstr "Information Technologies"

