"bilgisiyle hem kamu kurumlarında hem de özel sektörde başarılı kariyerler "
"yapabilmektedir."
msgstr ""
"Our graduates can make successful careers in both public institutions and "
"the private sector with the geographic information technologies and "
"engineering knowledge they acquire."

#: .\harita_muhendisligi\templates\harita_muhendisligi\includes\harita_muhendisligi.html:531
