"vardır."
msgstr ""
"Strengthening nursing will primarily be achieved through order, speaking the"
" same language and standards in professional practices. Therefore, there is "
"a need to strengthen the stage of creating and evaluating care plans for "
"nurses' practices within the scope of the professional values ​​and "
"philosophy of the profession while fulfilling their professional "
"obligations."

