msgstr ""
"First and Emergency Aid program graduates can work as Ambulance and "
"Emergency Care Technicians under the Ministry of Health if they receive the "
"required score from KPSS. They can also work as Ambulance and Emergency Care"
" Technicians in private health institutions and organizations and university"
" hospitals."

#: .\ilk_acil_yardim\templates\ilk_acil_yardim\includes\ilk_acil_yardim.html:519
msgid "İlk ve Acil Yardım Mezunları İçin İş Olanakları"
msgstr "Job Opportunities for First and Emergency Aid Graduates"

#: .\ilk_acil_yardim\templates\ilk_acil_yardim\includes\ilk_acil_yardim.html:522
msgid ""
"Mezunlarımız, edindikleri acil sağlık hizmetleri bilgisiyle hem kamu hem de "
"özel sektörde başarılı kariyerler yapabilmektedir."
msgstr ""
"Our graduates can make successful careers in both the public and private "
"sectors with the emergency health services knowledge they acquire."

#: .\ilk_acil_yardim\templates\ilk_acil_yardim\includes\ilk_acil_yardim.html:531
