"sürdürülebilirlik uzmanlığına kadar geniş bir yelpazede kariyer imkanları "
"bulunmaktadır."
msgstr ""
"Graduates of the Construction Technology Program can work in many different "
"positions by specializing in various fields of the construction industry. "
"There are a wide range of career opportunities, from construction management"
" to draftsmanship, from cost engineering to sustainability expertise."

