"sektördeki altyapı projelerinde ve şehir planlama birimlerinde önemli roller"
" üstlenirler."
msgstr ""
"Construction Technology Program graduates can pursue careers in wide and "
"diverse areas of the construction industry. Our graduates play important "
"roles, especially in construction companies, engineering consultancy "
"companies, infrastructure projects and urban planning units in the public "
"and private sectors."

