"wide variety of sectors such as industrial facilities, factories, mines, "
"construction sites, energy production areas, hospitals, schools, public "
"institutions, municipalities, logistics centers, shipyards, airports; They "
"can also serve more than one workplace through OSGBs and engage in "
"independent consultancy and training activities."

