"adaletin aksamadan her bir bireye eşit ve hızlı bir şekilde dağıtılmasını "
"sağlayacak profesyoneller yetiştirmeye amaçlamaktadır."
msgstr ""
"In this context, Avrasya University Court Office Services Associate Degree "
"Program; It aims to train professionals who will contribute to the smooth "
"execution of justice services, who are equipped with theoretical knowledge, "
"have a good command of practice, and will ensure that justice is distributed"
" equally and quickly to each individual without disruption in our country."

#: .\mahkeme_buro\templates\mahkeme_buro\includes\mahkeme_buro.html:763
