msgstr ""
"Within the scope of the principle of universities being active institutions "
"24/7, at Avrasya University, we provide our students with activities and "
"events where they can gain skills and experience in addition to theoretical "
"courses, both through various clubs and with the contributions of the "
"university."

#: .\maliye\templates\maliye\includes\maliye.html:769
msgid "Geleceğinize Yatırım"
msgstr "Investing in Your Future"

#: .\maliye\templates\maliye\includes\maliye.html:771
msgid ""
"Avrasya Üniversite'sinin öğrencilerine sağladığı günün koşullarına uygun ve "
"yenilikçi maliye eğitimi, geleceğinizin temelini oluşturacağına "
"inanmaktayız. Siz değerli gençleri Avrasya Üniversitesi Maliye Bölümü "
"ailesinde görmekten mutluluk duyacağız."
msgstr ""
"We believe that the modern and innovative finance education that Avrasya "
"University provides to its students will form the basis of your future. We "
"will be happy to see you, valuable young people, in the family of Avrasya "
"University Department of Finance."

#: .\maliye\templates\maliye\includes\maliye.html:784
