"bulunan Odyometri Programı örgün ve ikinci öğretimiyle aynı yıl eğitim "
"öğretim faaliyetlerine başlamıştır."
msgstr ""
"Avrasya University Vocational School of Health Services was established in "
"the 2013-2014 academic year. The Audiometry Program within the Department of"
" Medical Services and Techniques started its education activities in the "
"same year as its formal and secondary education."

