"isterlerse kendi işitme cihazı merkezlerini açabilirler."
msgstr ""
"Our graduate students can work in Audiology clinics of public or private "
"hospitals and Hearing Aid Companies under the supervision and supervision of"
" an Audiologist, Audiologist or Ear, Nose and Throat Diseases Specialist. "
"They can also open their own hearing aid centers if they wish."

