"program, if they are successful in the Vertical Transfer Exam opened by "
"ÖSYM; They can make vertical transfer to Labor Economics and Industrial "
"Relations, Insurance and Social Security, Social Services, Business "
"Administration, Economics and Finance undergraduate programs. Administrative"
" staff can also be promoted to managerial positions in the institutions and "
"businesses they work for."

#: .\sosyal_guvenlik\templates\sosyal_guvenlik\includes\sosyal_guvenlik.html:614
