"and international sports. By integrating theoretical knowledge with sports-"
"oriented practices, our program offers the opportunity to understand and "
"evaluate the cultural and national dynamics of the sports industry and "
"develop professional management skills. This program provides students with "
"the opportunity to specialize in the field of sports management by providing"
" them with the competence to identify, analyze and solve problems "
"encountered in the sports sector."

