"yanı sıra demokratik, katılımcı, şeffaf, öğrenci merkezli eğitim ve yönetim "
"anlayışıyla tanınan saygın bir kuruluş olmaktır."
msgstr ""
"In line with the general mission undertaken by Avrasya University, it "
"ensures that the principles of excellence and competence prevail in existing"
" postgraduate programs, and opens new programs that the country and society "
"need in the light of the latest developments in the globalizing world, "
"especially the Bolognization process; It is the most preferred by the "
"highest quality local and foreign students by doing serious work that will "
"set an example in research, education and relations with the society; To be "
"a respected institution whose degrees and diplomas are the most demanded "
"both in the academy and outside the academy, which allows scientific studies"
" to be carried out at the highest level of academic freedom, and which is "
